<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Progene Bio IVD Manufacturer"
  description="Privacy Policy for Nanjing Progene Biotechnology — how we collect, use and protect personal data submitted through our website."
  canonical="/privacy/"
>

  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: 2026-09-12</em></p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit an inquiry or RFQ, we collect the information you provide — typically your name, company, email address, phone number and the details of your request. We do not collect sensitive personal data through this website.</p>

    <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
    <p>We use your information solely to respond to your inquiry, prepare quotations, send samples and documentation, and support our business relationship with you. We do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties.</p>

    <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses only essential technical cookies required for basic functionality. We do not use third-party advertising or tracking cookies. You can disable cookies in your browser without affecting the core use of this site.</p>

    <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain inquiry data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected and to meet legal or regulatory obligations.</p>

    <h2>5. Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <p>If you are located in the EEA or UK, you have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your personal data, and to object to or restrict processing. To exercise these rights, contact us using the details on our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

    <h2>6. Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:martin@senobiocorp.com">martin@senobiocorp.com</a>.</p>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
